 "paragraphs": [
  "“Can we help?” Zade asked.",
  "“Yes, you can help me solve some riddles to get a password that will take me to the party,” the young falcon looked at Aliya and Zade with hope.",
  "“Let’s try,” Aliya offered.",
  "The young falcon flapped his wings in excitement. “For our first puzzle, we must see the red fox. We need to listen to him closely because he enjoys playing games,” said the falcon.",
  "“Follow me,” the falcon called as he flew from the tree."
